{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"online-whiteboard UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"ca","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"online-whiteboard.copy.howAnswer","keys":["online-whiteboard.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"ca","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Inicieu el tauler, escolliu Ploma o Selecciona, i després dibuixeu o afegiu notes curtes. Arrossegueu les notes per a organitzar- les; manteniu premuda la tecla Majús mentre seleccioneu per a escollir diverses notes, i llavors agregeu- les. Useu les tecles de fletxa del teclat per a moure les notes seleccionades i Suprimeix per a eliminar- les. Exporteu un ZXQPH0000QXZ quan estigui llest.","record_id":"1fe1dc1246f379befd2bb27cb14c634e2858368836d84638831b41c88134e635","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.660520597374955,"source":"Start the board, choose Pen or Select, then draw or add short notes. Drag notes to arrange them; hold Shift while selecting to choose several notes, then group them. Use the keyboard arrow keys to move selected notes and Delete to remove them. Export a PNG when ready.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"5bdbae264ee3c8a799b45c48cac5d4842083526af9947c673b808612e614d15a","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Inicieu el tauler, escolliu Ploma o Selecciona, i després dibuixeu o afegiu notes curtes. Arrossegueu les notes per a organitzar- les; manteniu premuda la tecla Majús mentre seleccioneu per a escollir diverses notes, i llavors agregeu- les. Useu les tecles de fletxa del teclat per a moure les notes seleccionades i Suprimeix per a eliminar- les. Exporteu un PNG quan estigui llest.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
